## Description

👉 AI Vision courses + Community → https://www.skool.com/ai-vision-academy
🛠️ Local labeling and model training software → https://visolabel.com

In this video, I compare YOLOv26 and RF-DETR in terms of speed, accuracy, segmentation quality, licensing, and real-world usage.

YOLOv26 is fast, lightweight, and easy to deploy.
RF-DETR is more accurate, stronger for segmentation, and better for complex scenes or small objects.

